<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barr Labs rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barr Labs rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal has cut its rating of Barr Laboratories to outperform (long-term) from outperform, citing the stock's recent move toward its price target of 40, the brokerage firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal also trimmed its earnings estimate for the quarter ending March 31 to $1.08 from $1.18 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Pomona, N.Y.-based generic drug maker traded at 38-1/4 on Monday, up 1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
